  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBEP-II consists of three main components: (i) Capacity-building for sector-wide reform and decentralization, (ii) Improving equitable access and quality of basic education, and (iii) Expanded learning opportunities for disadvantaged children and youth. It significantly contributes to realizing the rights of all Cambodian chichildren to quality basic education and strengthening the Ministry&apos;s capacities.</narrative>
